    ICommandBuffer ..> IRenderPass : attachment semantics
    ICommandBuffer ..> IRenderTarget : target
    ICommandBuffer --> IRenderEncoder : scoped encoding
    ICommandBuffer --> IComputeEncoder : scoped encoding
    ICommandBuffer --> ICopyEncoder : scoped encoding
    IRenderEncoder ..> IPipeline : graphics only
    IComputeEncoder ..> IPipeline : compute only
    IRenderEncoder ..> IBindGroup : binds
    IComputeEncoder ..> IBindGroup : binds
    IRenderEncoder ..> IBuffer : vertex and index buffers
    ICopyEncoder ..> IBuffer : copies
    ICopyEncoder ..> ITexture : copies
